---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Image from '../../components/OptimizedImage.astro';
import reflectionsImage from '../../../assets/reflections_1.jpg';

const blogPostingSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Reflections Paint & Body Works: Collision Repair in Shelby, NC | Shelby Web Company",
  "description": "A community spotlight on Reflections Paint & Body Works, a family-owned collision repair shop serving Shelby and Cleveland County since 2015.",
  "author": { "@type": "Person", "name": "Dave Richardson", "jobTitle": "Founder / Lead Developer", "url": "https://www.shelbywebco.com/about/" },
  "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Shelby Web Company", "logo": { "@type": "ImageObject", "url": "https://www.shelbywebco.com/og-image.jpg" } },
  "mainEntityOfPage": "https://www.shelbywebco.com/blog/reflections-paint-body-works-spotlight/"
};
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Reflections Paint & Body Works: Collision Repair in Shelby, NC"
  description="A community spotlight on Reflections Paint & Body Works, a family-owned collision repair shop serving Shelby and Cleveland County since 2015."
>
  <script is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(blogPostingSchema)} type="application/ld+json"></script>
  <article class="pt-24 pb-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <header class="mb-10 text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#c9a86a]/20 bg-[#c9a86a]/5">
          <span class="text-[#c9a86a] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Community Spotlight</span>
          <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#c9a86a]/30"></span>
          <span class="text-white/90 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">August 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black text-white mb-8 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
          Collision Repair Rooted in <a href="/web-design-shelby-nc/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">Shelby</a>: <br />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue">Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works</span>
        </h1>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          When a vehicle needs collision repair, drivers want clear information, careful workmanship, and a dependable path back to the road.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works is a family-owned collision repair shop serving drivers in Shelby and the surrounding area.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Located at 2314 South Post Road, the shop has served the community since 2015. Its work spans collision repairs, paint and dent services, glass replacement, and related support for drivers navigating repairs.
        </p>

        <div class="my-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl max-w-[640px] mx-auto">
          <Image src={reflectionsImage} alt="Reflections Paint & Body Works Shelby" class="w-full h-auto" />
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">Serving Shelby Drivers Since 2015</h2>
        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Reflections is a family-owned and operated collision repair facility that has been in business since 2015, serving drivers in and around <a href="/web-design-shelby-nc/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">Shelby</a> and Cleveland County.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          The shop brings decades of hands-on collision repair experience to its work. Reflections says it uses modern equipment and quality repair materials, and backs workmanship with a lifetime warranty for as long as the customer owns the vehicle.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">A Professional, Welcoming Shop</h2>
        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          On a recent visit to the South Post Road shop, I had the chance to meet Will in person. He was professional and welcoming, and the shop looked great—clean, well-kept, and inviting.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Collision repairs can involve several steps, from an initial estimate to coordinating with an insurer and completing the work. Reflections emphasizes clear communication and helping customers understand what to expect throughout the process. The shop also works with major insurance companies and offers free estimates and towing.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">More Than Just Paint</h2>
        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Reflections offers a full range of collision and body work services to get you safely back on the road:
        </p>

        <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 list-none p-0 mb-12">
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[#c9a86a]">✦</span><span class="text-white">Collision &amp; structural repair</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[#c9a86a]">✦</span><span class="text-white">Paintless dent repair</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[#c9a86a]">✦</span><span class="text-white">Glass &amp; windshield replacement</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[#c9a86a]">✦</span><span class="text-white">Detailing</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[#c9a86a]">✦</span><span class="text-white">Insurance assistance</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[#c9a86a]">✦</span><span class="text-white">Free estimates &amp; towing</span></li>
        </ul>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          These services are intended to help customers handle repairs in one place and get back on the road.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">Supporting Local Businesses Matters</h2>
        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Local repair businesses play an important role in helping people maintain the vehicles they rely on every day.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works is one of the locally owned businesses serving Shelby and Cleveland County. Its long-running presence and range of repair services make it a local option for drivers looking for collision and body work.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Drivers looking for collision repair, dent removal, glass replacement, or detailing can contact Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works to ask about services and request an estimate.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#c9a86a] to-brand-darkest p-10 rounded-[2rem] text-center relative overflow-hidden my-12">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_50%,rgba(201,168,106,0.15),transparent_70%)]"></div>
          <p class="text-white text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium relative z-10">
            Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works has served Shelby-area drivers since 2015, offering collision repair and related services from its South Post Road location.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-white mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Interested in learning more about Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works Shelby?
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Visit their website to explore their services, request an estimate, or get directions to the South Post Road shop:
        </p>

        <p class="mb-12">
          <a href="https://www.reflectionspaint-shelby.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline decoration-brand-cyan/30 underline-offset-4">https://www.reflectionspaint-shelby.com/</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 p-8 bg-brand-dark/50 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">More Community Spotlights</h2>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-white/90">
          <p>Read more about local organizations and businesses: <a href="/blog/newtons-karate-jimmy-newton-spotlight/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">Newton's Karate</a>, <a href="/blog/daniel-thomas-mayor-boiling-springs-spotlight/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">a Boiling Springs community spotlight</a>, and <a href="/blog/fs-expedited-llc-spotlight/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">F&amp;S Expedited LLC</a>.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">Love seeing local businesses thrive? We spotlight Cleveland County companies through our <a href="/services/web-design/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">web design</a> and <a href="/services/seo/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">local SEO</a> services.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="mt-24 pt-12 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-wrap gap-8 items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/blog/" class="text-white/90 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back to Blog
        </a>
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <a href="/" class="text-white/90 hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
          <a href="/about/" class="text-white/90 hover:text-white transition-colors">About Us</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="text-white/90 hover:text-white transition-colors">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>